{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12936","headline":"留题宁川香盖寺壁 · 韩翃","name":"留题宁川香盖寺壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱远登高尘眼开。\n爲怜萧寺上经台，山川谁识龙蛇蛰。\n天地自迎风雨来，柳放寒条秋已老。\n雁摇孤翼暮空回，何人会得其中事。\n又被残花落日催。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}